<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11299] During SSL Handshake GridNioServer.processWrite is invoked constantly</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11299</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Causes busy looping in processSelectionKeyOptimized()&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This also causes problems on Windows/Java 11 since if key is always ready for writing it will never be shown as ready for reading.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The reason for this behavior that during handshake we never un-listen OP_WRITE&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13215261">IGNITE-11299</key>
