                            <comment id="16767225" author="ilyak" created="Wed, 13 Feb 2019 14:12:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=yzhdanov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;yzhdanov&quot;&gt;yzhdanov&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sboikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sboikov&quot;&gt;sboikov&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt; please review NIO SSL patch.&lt;/p&gt;

